<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam yr-yr inflation steady at 1.6 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Vietnam yr-yr inflation steady at 1.6 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam's General Statistics Office issued the following economic indicators on Saturday:</p>
<p> VIETNAM CONSUMER PRICES		May 97     Apr 97     May 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month percentage change    -0.5	 -0.6	 -0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year percentage change	+1.6	 +1.6	 +6.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100 = prev. Dec)	 101.0	101.5	103.8</p>
</text>
